  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これが魔科学兵器の力なんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So this is the power
of a magitech weapon...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>多くの人の命を奪って、さらに星のマナも
食らいつくす、それが魔科学兵器、か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Taking countless lives and devouring the whole
world's mana... That's what a magitech weapon is for...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41504</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>禁止して正解だったよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We were right to
abolish them, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41592</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、これも失敗があっての答え……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that was a result
of our mistakes, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41700</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>たくさんの人が犠牲になってから
ダメだったって気付く……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>People only realized they were bad because
there were so many victims already...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>人はそうして過ちを過ちとして
認めるんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's how people
recognize their mistakes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41928</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_095_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そのためにこの世界の歴史も一度、
変えられなければならなかった、&lt;Cless&gt;たちの手で</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And that's why &lt;Cless&gt; and the others had no
choice but to change the course of Aselia's history.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
